{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "8ddd75269d6365173861130b4c783e1bbc0ac9680e3bf650a73567ef7d60b21d", "ja": "Let's go ミリオンパーク！", "zh": "Let's go 百万公园！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7c1abfb71abd85ba5d7c46b997e22e91029c0167932a1959e7c2ab94199700c9", "ja": "首都近郊の自然公園、ミリオンパークの記念\n祝典に参加する事になった亜美、茜、昴、こ\nのみ。話を聞くと、どうやら亜美の家の近所\nらしい。仕事のため、みんなで遊びに……い\nや、下見に行くことになった。", "zh": "亚美、茜、昴和このみ决定参加首都近郊自然公园“百万公园”的纪念庆典。听说之后，才知道那里似乎就在亚美家附近。为了工作，大家决定一起去玩……不，是去踩点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d5dd169ed6b844bae8e26bb53a1f36c59d2dfdabee04380aa02c4de694df570a", "ja": "（ミリオンパーク記念式典イベントに出演する\nメンバーが決まった。みんな、もう来てるかな？）", "zh": "（百万公园纪念典礼活动的出演成员已经决定了。大家已经到了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "435c5fb9ec5eb3c9fbe79253f3f49780491ccc780b68e6eef991c9a9d325fc92", "ja": "亜美、早くしないと……あっ！\n{$P$}！", "zh": "亚美，要是不快点的话……啊！  \n{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "06b178b8f966a79dcb4cbd74fafe00bb4f419f6ea6a477b139422edac2e36d41", "ja": "えっ？　……ああっ！？\n兄ちゃん、来るのが早いよ～あと5分したら来て！", "zh": "咦？……啊啊！？  \n哥哥，你来得太早啦～再过5分钟再来嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "886deb86b60518846e0f03f2b4821f2f6665b6bb442839ec71885e4cb3618904", "ja": "やあやあ、{$P$}ちゃん！\nこっち、こっち見て！　すごい美少女がいるよ！", "zh": "嗨呀嗨呀，{$P$}！\n看这边，看这边！有个超级美少女哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8442a75c505bbb11b26fb4554071d3f2d7a0d5f5f7ecdcadb562c085bdb43fd9", "ja": "うん、そうだな……。\nで、みんなして、何を隠してるんだ？", "zh": "嗯，是啊……  \n话说回来，你们到底在藏什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "b6028a241441364c4d52e2cfd9a9cc62483cfc73ae7932714299f1a2a28b7007", "ja": "え、なんのこと？\n亜美たち、別に何も隠してないよ？", "zh": "诶，什么事？\n亚美她们又没藏什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "72f881eb5156d71d206f5d1a302c7bf7a49ac7e5c3e1c192faa002c479b1c305", "ja": "ふふっ、もう観念したら？\nあのね{$P$}、実は……。", "zh": "呵呵，认命了吧？\n那个呢，{$P$}，其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "be8bdbe1611495e98e493a2557d612ae91eb058531c01cc6ff06c350fbb0f155", "ja": "みんなで、{$P$}の座る椅子に、\n水風船を仕掛けようとしてたみたいなの。", "zh": "大家好像是打算在{$P$}坐的椅子上，\n放水气球恶作剧的样子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "729edca12544b76d0e2cf99bfdbf845574e0105e0ff6da5e6a7e05bb533e3c53", "ja": "ええええっ！？\nこ、このみんの、ウラギリモノー！", "zh": "诶诶诶诶！？\n小、小好你的叛徒——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "13979233429c70be947e89b67504b712d7a1706f4c7aa1fa1c25fbd3359c8ca8", "ja": "ふーん……。お前達、揃って\nそんなイタズラをしようとしてたのか……。", "zh": "哦……原来你们几个是打算一起搞这种恶作剧啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "553bc07cb47a9745de21887e6bce5ecd0a86d8b74da82d8df2e5d617f216127e", "ja": "だ、だって～。ほら、これから暑くなるだろ？\n熱中症対策になるって、亜美が言うから！", "zh": "可、可是～你看，接下来不是要变热了吗？因为亚美说这样能预防中暑嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "6f61b1e37ccc9c33e5f1362fd722713bd6568ea11064c6c7eac0426e732e86ac", "ja": "悪気はなかったんだよ？　むしろ、思いやりだよ？\n許してくれるよね？　ナデナデしていいから！", "zh": "我没有恶意嘛？反而是出于体贴哦？\n你会原谅我的吧？让你摸摸头也可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "1e922e9b06e4d94c931f5e5bcbb451bd4bb3f246cd2c76a4492b39f92aec3114", "ja": "くっ……さすが兄ちゃん、ヤリ手プロデューサーだね？\n一瞬でみんなを味方につけるなんて！", "zh": "呜……不愧是哥哥，真是个有两下子的制作人呢？\n居然一瞬间就把大家都拉到自己这边了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f5dbaaf662a4e7734dcae72edd1c6efe2cf4b997785510a046600fe451701433", "ja": "わかったわかった。ヤリ手になりたいとは思ってるよ。\nだから、仕事の話をさせてくれ。", "zh": "好啦好啦。我也确实想成为精明能干的人啊。\n所以，让我先谈谈工作的事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "dec35c77ee58fe282de4f916e065646928f6e5a758448512ccdb2f381bc71518", "ja": "そう、大事なのはそれよ！\n私たちが集められたのって……もしかして？", "zh": "没错，重要的就是这个！把我们召集到一起……难道是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "78bcc6af576741a5dffb54ef8aeb6cea86131cc971b0f3b0256fe48940af1978", "ja": "ええ、そうなんです。次の仕事は\nこの4人に、新曲を歌ってもらおうと思って。", "zh": "对，就是这样。下一项工作是想让这4个人演唱新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "6af8608bed8355fbba8e669a5398c7072229db2420d5df83883afb5d577ca43f", "ja": "え、ええ～っ、新曲！？", "zh": "诶，诶诶～！新歌！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "0b7060cdf077616b32082b042ef971cbc690e4c5ca264b9bb784f4dc85d4cdbf", "ja": "やった～！", "zh": "太好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "f9ca899713e27af6e26b352276332a4dbe1bdb196250e41afd15783ecce1be41", "ja": "やった～♪", "zh": "太好啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "3ffa1eba9735e0493ea5b95c03abe7095d9e0473d56918db0490094c4c937ef4", "ja": "う、うあうあ～！　イタズラを見破っただけじゃなく、\n亜美にこんなサプライズを仕掛けるなんて……！", "zh": "呜、呜哇哇～！不仅识破了我的恶作剧，\n居然还反过来给了亚美这么大一个惊喜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1020_011ami", "source_sha256": "7d10e340ab1cfd1a1b0ca94acdecab31207bd66761df7e0becc082b3c450f1c0", "ja": "ふっ……負けたぜ、兄ちゃん。カンパイだ。", "zh": "呵……我输了，哥哥。干杯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "4740594bfa4eb6d77ec124041cebcfb754c442a98188ee481e688f339bda8e26", "ja": "亜美は何と戦っていたんだ……？\nまあとにかく、そういう事だ。みんな、よろしく！", "zh": "亚美到底是在和什么战斗啊……？\n总之，就是这么回事。大家，拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "2c1153b53b8ba33fc22b4de8a7a1c49d06a4143b9d4f1d9f2fe1907604dba68a", "ja": "なあ、{$P$}！\nその仕事って、どんな内容？　詳しい話はまだ？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}！\n那个工作具体是什么内容？详细情况还没说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "e19d67e043f32429d38786de5ff2c33d872c9f8c2e3e4c04aa36e1fe02c26ac0", "ja": "ええと、ミリオンパークっていう大きな公園の、\n記念式典イベントに出てくれっていうオファーだよ。", "zh": "呃，是邀请我们参加一个叫百万公园的大型公园的纪念典礼活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "5643ec90058b4f23cf97c5fff0cfa0b582da240a92901df1d43e69dad6ae7848", "ja": "新曲はイベントステージで歌うだけじゃなくて、\nCMでも使われる予定だそうだ。", "zh": "听说这首新歌不只会在活动舞台上演唱，还计划用于广告。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1025_047sub", "source_sha256": "03696872cde3b630186ce72fbd4ad7e9b8f3b93e079154c8e56868daa31b5e62", "ja": "えっ、CMソングになるの！？　すっげー！\nなんか有名なアイドルみたいだな♪", "zh": "诶，要成为广告歌了吗！？太棒了！\n感觉就像那些知名偶像一样呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "fc9c1a5b2ee00b90b40e76b1f2778f9a9940d9c8c3aad698719bae3b7f476042", "ja": "オッケーだよ、{$P$}ちゃん。\n記念日の盛り上げ役なら、茜ちゃんにまかせろ～！", "zh": "没问题哦，{$P$}。\n要是负责炒热纪念日气氛，就交给小茜吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1027_011ami", "source_sha256": "1386a63cd55f5299ba34a1ee851d7165c1dbfb791f5078ebeaebc982011bfebc", "ja": "えっ？　兄ちゃん今、ミリオンパークって言った？\nそれって、亜美んちの近くじゃん！", "zh": "咦？哥哥刚才说的是百万公园？那不是就在亜美家附近嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "4c96b470ead94e33c7440e59c0262517513b40765268711b5a545a781381c16b", "ja": "あれ、そうだったのか？", "zh": "哎，是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1029_011ami", "source_sha256": "e07c09610cb97207524adca3b564378d948be24101d17ddc89eae911ea333db0", "ja": "そうだよ～！　広くて思いっきり遊べる公園だから、\nみんなで行ったら、メチャ楽しいと思うよ！", "zh": "没错～！那可是个很大、能尽情玩耍的公园，\n大家一起去的话，我觉得肯定会超级开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1030_047sub", "source_sha256": "cfffa52e75008afaf72543d840acc5ea0eab5a7abdcae3672c41f5563a64230d", "ja": "へー、そうなのか？　じゃあさ、せっかくだから\n仕事が終わったらみんなでパーッと遊ぼうぜ！", "zh": "哦——是这样吗？那正好，工作结束后大家一起痛痛快快地玩吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1031_023aka", "source_sha256": "f4a0e4fb1407ec80f6dc3f54fbc50334d32b71c865113844fe2b345e6b539ff6", "ja": "ふっふっふ……亜美ちゃん、すばるん。\n茜ちゃんだって、遊ぶことなら負けないよ？", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……亚美、小昴。小茜在玩乐方面也不会输哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "3d9d37e2bae5931969f57909f7495642f2a6d156b17446faac0bbda8156f038c", "ja": "一応、仕事で行くんだからな？　みんな……。", "zh": "好歹也是去工作的，大家……知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1033_039kon", "source_sha256": "f51b88edbad83655c3e134939d1425008631dc3f8587009508f6fe2dc421d85b", "ja": "なるほど。昴ちゃんに茜ちゃん、それに亜美ちゃん。\nこのメンバーに私がいるってことは……。", "zh": "原来如此。昴、小茜，还有亚美。这个阵容里有我，也就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1034_039kon", "source_sha256": "b112964557ae5bb00e4553fc669c90b8c547dae89c1169b4c4b3bc9167ea6729", "ja": "お姉さんには、全部わかったわ！\n私に期待されているのは、年長者ポジションね？", "zh": "姐姐我已经全明白了！大家期待我的，是年长者的定位吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "620db8d879c8ea2cf39440ef273c4d401752b8f6c422fd0ccb7d1201a97873c2", "ja": "え？　あ、ええ……そうですね！\n年長者として、頼らせてもらってもいいですか？", "zh": "咦？啊，嗯……是这样没错！\n可以把我当作年长者来依靠吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1036_039kon", "source_sha256": "ef6222d8b439d6c1067c0899b2f8f92978379848c812ebcf9bc38f57fdd223cd", "ja": "ウフフッ、まかせてちょうだい♪\n私がみんなをしっかり、サポートするから。", "zh": "呵呵，交给我吧♪\n我会好好支持大家的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1037_011ami", "source_sha256": "eb04a8d4996874df2947080568492a26dcac9cddcef1edd612041188d6267a8c", "ja": "よーし、そうと決まれば、\nさっそくみんなで、ミリオンパークに遊びに行こうよ！", "zh": "好～嘞，既然决定了，\n那大家就快点一起去百万公园玩吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1038_011ami", "source_sha256": "c00c304d99c2e7d2cc72874534acfbfdbf3331c4a9304843a9479b1137161626", "ja": "それじゃ兄ちゃん、ダンドリよろよろ～♪", "zh": "那哥哥，接下来就拜托你安排啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "0d3826d9487c7c78cd6dc2d257dc761a85e38a940413e02f92bcb786265dedf4", "ja": "えっ、俺？", "zh": "诶，我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1040_023aka", "source_sha256": "6f8629c0d03feadb9eb52211afaa3bcd12b79041cbced21e492f543223e8817b", "ja": "だって茜ちゃんたち、そこでお仕事するんでしょ？\n現場の下見はしないと！　すばるんもそう思うよね？", "zh": "因为小茜要在那里工作吧？\n不提前去现场看看可不行！昴昴也这么觉得吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1041_047sub", "source_sha256": "fee4f581c85cfe5964fb48fd787b1dfdf4e7cf031c19189b409abd1c67502435", "ja": "え、{$P$}が連れてってくれんの？\nだったらオレ、うれしいな！", "zh": "诶，{$P$}要带我去吗？\n那样的话，我可高兴了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1042_p", "source_sha256": "87e37e813c0a49d59abda2b89e023c932fd1a29ca0181f8fca1c5407c0460a16", "ja": "なんていうか……\nこういうときは本当に、息がピッタリなんだな。", "zh": "怎么说呢……这种时候，我们真的特别合拍啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1043_039kon", "source_sha256": "0143a7a4d49cd8a9c759e40be6bb49f8ea196b38d7eb1f87cd6cd133a4aa5a08", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}！\n私もミリオンパーク、行ってみたかったの。", "zh": "喂，{$P$}！\n我也一直很想去百万乐园看看呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1044_039kon", "source_sha256": "09c6721fa5964c6fc3bf8f3ca6196f72abbb87b447dff533e17f71122d6b0ef7", "ja": "大人も楽しめる公園、っていうところが、\n私にピッタリだと思わない？", "zh": "“大人也能尽情畅玩的公园”，这一点\n不觉得非常适合我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1045_p", "source_sha256": "0e0895f74996223662d26760a7a0e979f0711a5899bf5302fc4764f97716cede", "ja": "このみさんもですか？\nまあ確かに、ちょっと楽しそうではありますね。", "zh": "连这个美也姐也是吗？\n嗯，确实感觉好像还挺有意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1046_p", "source_sha256": "69cdf6d776aab2f716053f59b29c6e3629f094b133972acf24d71028c3730162", "ja": "よし、わかった！\nみんながそう言うなら、下見に行ってみよう。", "zh": "好，我知道了！\n既然大家都这么说了，那就去踩个点看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_01_1047_011ami", "source_sha256": "0b7060cdf077616b32082b042ef971cbc690e4c5ca264b9bb784f4dc85d4cdbf", "ja": "やった～！", "zh": "太好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
